{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["And they <b>rebelled and grieved.</b> From the root of אל תעצבו (Genesis 45:5), by way of parable. And some say that רוח קדשו is the Angel of the Presence; it fought against them, until they departed from His land."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 63, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:00:50.152542043Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}